{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/sbalhatlani/status/2103475507471806929","id":"2103475507471806929","text":"🚨 OPUS 5.5 ONE SHOT Anime episode\n\nI made an 8½-minute Arabic-dubbed anime pilot, «شظية الفجر» (Shard of Dawn), in about 14 hours, directing Claude Opus 5.5 in Claude Code.\n\nCharacters, voices, music, animation, final render. Episode 1 👇\n\nOpus 5.5 didn't just write code. It ran the production like a studio:\n• planned 211 shots from my script\n• built a custom 2D animation engine from scratch\n• cast 11 voices and directed 70 lines of Arabic dub\n• wrote the sound mixer, subtitles and render pipeline\n\nBy the numbers:\n🎬 211 shots · 8:33 runtime\n🎨 300+ generated images (characters, locations, cut-ins)\n🎙️ 70 voiced lines · 11 characters\n🎵 16 music cues · 105 sound effects\n⏱️ ~14 hours from first API call to final render\n\nWhat blew me away ONE SHOT IT.\n\nThe stack:\n• Claude Code + Opus 5.5: director, engineer, QA\n• ElevenLabs v3: voices, music, sound effects\n• an image model: the artwork\n\nThe engine, timing, lip flaps, mix and subtitles are all code Opus wrote. One person, one day.\n\nShould I make episode 2? 👀\n\n#ClaudeAI #Anime #AIart","raw_text":{"text":"🚨 OPUS 5.5 ONE SHOT Anime episode\n\nI made an 8½-minute Arabic-dubbed anime pilot, «شظية الفجر» (Shard of Dawn), in about 14 hours, directing Claude Opus 5.5 in Claude Code.\n\nCharacters, voices, music, animation, final render. Episode 1 👇\n\nOpus 5.5 didn't just write code. It ran the production like a studio:\n• planned 211 shots from my script\n• built a custom 2D animation engine from scratch\n• cast 11 voices and directed 70 lines of Arabic dub\n• wrote the sound mixer, subtitles and render pipeline\n\nBy the numbers:\n🎬 211 shots · 8:33 runtime\n🎨 300+ generated images (characters, locations, cut-ins)\n🎙️ 70 voiced lines · 11 characters\n🎵 16 music cues · 105 sound effects\n⏱️ ~14 hours from first API call to final render\n\nWhat blew me away ONE SHOT IT.\n\nThe stack:\n• Claude Code + Opus 5.5: director, engineer, QA\n• ElevenLabs v3: voices, music, sound effects\n• an image model: the artwork\n\nThe engine, timing, lip flaps, mix and subtitles are all code Opus wrote. One person, one day.\n\nShould I make episode 2? 👀\n\n#ClaudeAI #Anime #AIart","display_text_range":[0,1047],"facets":[{"type":"media","indices":[279,302],"id":"2103472733782786049","display":"pic.x.com/na1gnEQdeE","original":"https://t.co/na1gnEQdeE","replacement":"https://x.com/sbalhatlani/status/2103475507471806929/video/1"},{"type":"media","indices":[279,302],"id":"2103474310190858241","display":"pic.x.com/na1gnEQdeE","original":"https://t.co/na1gnEQdeE","replacement":"https://x.com/sbalhatlani/status/2103475507471806929/video/1"},{"type":"hashtag","indices":[1017,1026],"original":"ClaudeAI"},{"type":"hashtag","indices":[1027,1033],"original":"Anime"},{"type":"hashtag","indices":[1034,1040],"original":"AIart"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"sbalhatlani","url":"https://x.com/sbalhatlani","id":"228391413","followers":4879,"following":1823,"likes":4760,"media_count":982,"name":"ص","description":"🍓Digital NoMad\nFounder:\nhttp://Ters.co | http://WoWAR.co | http://WoWVo.co | https://Arabicsubs.com\n\nودك تدعمني ؟ إشترلي كوب☕️قهوة👇","raw_description":{"text":"🍓Digital NoMad\nFounder:\nhttps://t.co/GsYA7SZ1Fx | https://t.co/S2IoNwCSM9 | https://t.co/JyJm4npcnr | https://t.co/4iqSjrtAPV\n\nودك تدعمني ؟ إشترلي كوب☕️قهوة👇","facets":[{"type":"url","indices":[24,47],"original":"https://t.co/GsYA7SZ1Fx","replacement":"http://Ters.co","display":"Ters.co"},{"type":"url","indices":[50,73],"original":"https://t.co/S2IoNwCSM9","replacement":"http://WoWAR.co","display":"WoWAR.co"},{"type":"url","indices":[76,99],"original":"https://t.co/JyJm4npcnr","replacement":"http://WoWVo.co","display":"WoWVo.co"},{"type":"url","indices":[102,125],"original":"https://t.co/4iqSjrtAPV","replacement":"https://Arabicsubs.com","display":"Arabicsubs.com"}]},"location":"Valley","banner_url":